      <p source="#source-258-272"><seg source="#source-258-272">のろいな</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-272-289"><seg source="#source-272-289">なのはなの</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-289-327"><seg source="#source-289-327">はたけのなかをゆく汽車は</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-327-335"><seg source="#source-327-335">ひら</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-335-343"><seg source="#source-335-343">ひら</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-343-354"><seg source="#source-343-354">ひいら</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-354-380"><seg source="#source-354-380">あとからその汽車</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-380-419"><seg source="#source-380-395">追つかける</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-395-419"><rb>蝶々</rb><rt>てふてふ</rt></ruby></p>
